# Block: Isolate margins keeps the margins of the first and the last child inside the block.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: en
	Title: Block · Isolate margins
	Page:
		Paper: A4
		Margin: 20mm
	Styles:
		For style: piece
			Box:
				Margin: 16 0 16 0
				Padding: 6 8
				Background: tint
		For style: holder
			Box:
				Background: sand
	Section:
		Text: Block
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Isolate margins
		Paragraph: Without border or padding, the margins of the first and the last child come out of the block and its background does not cover them. With `Isolate margins: true` they stay inside.
			Style: intro
		Text: Isolate margins: false (by default)
			Style: label
